title: Party Unity
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: party_disunity_timer <= 0 and dissent_percent >= 8
on-arrival: party_disunity_timer = 10

= Party Unity

The party's factions are quarreling. Unity is a resource; disunity is a drain.

- @unity_retreat: Hold a unity retreat
- @big_tent: Promise every faction a seat at the table
- @crack_whip: Enforce discipline
- @easy_discard

@unity_retreat
subtitle: -1 resource
unavailable-subtitle: Need 1 resource.
choose-if: resources >= 1
on-arrival: progressive_dissent -= 6; establishment_dissent -= 6; labor_dissent -= 6; moderate_dissent -= 6; abundance_dissent -= 6; populist_dissent -= 6; resources -= 1; month_actions += 1

Leaders talk it out. Grievances remain, but they are heard.

@big_tent
on-arrival: progressive_dissent -= 3; moderate_dissent -= 3; labor_dissent -= 3; populist_dissent -= 3; abundance_dissent -= 3; establishment_dissent -= 3; budget -= 1; month_actions += 1

Platform planks and committee seats are distributed to all.

@crack_whip
on-arrival: progressive_dissent += 3; moderate_dissent += 3; establishment_dissent -= 8; resources += 1; month_actions += 1

Leadership imposes order. The establishment is pleased; rebels are not.
